{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.DeltaQDecoration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.DeltaQDecoration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.RepresentationTheory.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.delta_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.delta_q","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-q-decoration.lean#L41-L47","doc":"Concrete model: the indexing type for the per-irrep tuple is the\nfinite type of partitions of `n`, here represented by the\nlist-based partition records `Fin (Nat.partition.length n)`.\nThe full per-irrep matrix data (q-deformed Specht modules in\nseminormal basis) is the upgrade target documented above. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:delta-q-decoration","label":"def:delta-q-decoration","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-q-decoration.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaQDecorationConjecture.delta_q_map","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaQDecorationConjecture.delta_q_map","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-q-decoration.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The placeholder delta_q map. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaQDecorationConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaQDecorationConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/delta-q-decoration.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaQDecorationConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaQDecora